WEBVTT

00:14.630 --> 00:19.600
The sweet whispers of love only happen twice.

00:20.880 --> 00:25.970
Before you know it, you're taken prisoner. Chocolat à la folie.

00:27.440 --> 00:32.390
The stardust of dawn is inlaid in the sky.

00:33.850 --> 00:38.820
My emerald eyes have you in their sights!

00:40.250 --> 00:45.000
Sugar Sugar Rune! Choco Choco Rune!

00:46.640 --> 00:51.470
The sparkling hearts are secret jewels.

00:52.930 --> 00:58.220
Even if the boys bully you,

00:59.400 --> 01:04.400
They've just fallen in love. Chocolat à la folie.

01:05.890 --> 01:10.860
They're really in love with you. Chocolat à la folie.

01:23.350 --> 01:25.200
Chocolat à la folie.

01:46.290 --> 01:49.480
We shouldn't have come
after all, Chocolat-chan.

01:49.480 --> 01:51.860
It'll be fine, Vanilla.

01:55.130 --> 01:56.030
I wanna go home...

01:58.400 --> 02:01.100
How exactly did we get to this point?

02:07.580 --> 02:08.380
Pardon me for a second.

02:11.770 --> 02:12.510
Hey...

02:15.280 --> 02:21.070
Prince, about this weekend's trip,
what time should we depart?

02:22.560 --> 02:25.290
A Members-only trip, you know.

02:25.930 --> 02:27.960
We'll be staying with the Prince.

02:28.660 --> 02:29.500
Will you come too?

02:30.800 --> 02:32.870
And your friend over there as well.

02:33.170 --> 02:33.970
Prince!

02:34.370 --> 02:36.500
You're inviting those children?

02:36.840 --> 02:40.440
They'll trample all over your villa, and –

02:41.080 --> 02:42.240
Stop it.

02:43.210 --> 02:44.710
If you'd like, please come.

02:46.210 --> 02:49.950
The Prince's villa has a
wonderful view of the sea.

02:50.790 --> 02:54.060
Alright... This time I'll
take your heart, Pierre.

02:56.090 --> 02:56.690
And also...

02:58.130 --> 03:01.740
I want to know why he looks
identical to the Ice Prince.

03:02.260 --> 03:02.960
Hey, you two.

03:04.330 --> 03:06.200
The Prince looks bored.

03:07.040 --> 03:08.940
Since you were invited...

03:09.370 --> 03:12.070
...please entertain the Prince.

03:13.880 --> 03:15.940
Do some kind of performance or something.

03:16.440 --> 03:18.450
Some entertainment until we reach the villa.

03:20.980 --> 03:23.390
The Prince wants to see
it as well, doesn't he?

03:23.950 --> 03:24.520
Yes, I do.

03:25.520 --> 03:27.420
But what should we do?

03:27.890 --> 03:28.960
Ignore them!

03:35.060 --> 03:36.660
You two came along?

03:40.970 --> 03:43.030
The Prince is laughing?

03:44.310 --> 03:48.410
You did it. Since when did you
two have talent in magic?

03:49.140 --> 03:52.850
Well, since we were going to the villa,
I thought that I could do some magic and...

03:52.850 --> 03:53.980
Ta-da!

03:55.050 --> 03:57.020
That's enough already!!

03:58.420 --> 03:59.290
You see?

04:06.490 --> 04:08.800
A Lady's Vacances Date

04:16.140 --> 04:16.600
Lovely!

04:17.770 --> 04:21.510
Now then, everyone. Let's get changed
and rendezvous on the beach.

04:22.580 --> 04:23.010
Let's go!

04:23.580 --> 04:23.810
Okay.

04:24.550 --> 04:25.910
Well, see you later.

04:29.550 --> 04:32.390
Alright, this time I'm gonna
take your heart, Pierre.

04:35.960 --> 04:37.330
The rooms are also lovely.

04:37.330 --> 04:40.330
Indeed! Very suitable for
a person such as myself.

04:40.330 --> 04:42.560
Man, why'd you come along?

04:43.200 --> 04:45.200
Even magical familiars need vacances.

04:45.630 --> 04:47.440
The ocean is calling me!

04:47.440 --> 04:49.900
Listen up! Don't do any
other unnecessary things!

04:49.900 --> 04:53.680
Oh, don't worry about me. I'm just
gonna kick back and relax.

04:54.540 --> 04:56.610
Then get outta here so I can change!

04:59.310 --> 05:01.580
Ta-da! All set!

05:02.880 --> 05:04.190
It's a little embarrasing, isn't it?

05:04.890 --> 05:08.090
No it's not! It's cute, Vanilla!

05:09.320 --> 05:10.960
I'm all set, too!

05:11.490 --> 05:12.490
Let's hurry up and go!

05:13.090 --> 05:14.300
Let's go!

05:25.810 --> 05:28.220
Doesn't it seem like we're little kids?

05:28.940 --> 05:30.310
But we are little kids.

05:31.650 --> 05:32.750
No excuses.

05:36.320 --> 05:37.190
Wanna play together?

05:40.820 --> 05:44.530
The Prince isn't going to want to do
something as childish as that.

05:44.890 --> 05:47.360
Look, just go and play with the other
elementary school kids over there.

05:48.860 --> 05:49.950
Okay, then let's go swimming.

05:50.630 --> 05:53.450
It's better just to do nothing
at a resort like this.

05:53.700 --> 05:55.240
You just don't get it, do you.

06:00.280 --> 06:01.280
Let's go, Vanilla.

06:02.340 --> 06:04.010
Wait up, Chocolat-chan!

06:04.010 --> 06:05.810
Play safe now!

06:06.350 --> 06:07.620
Don't get yourself lost!

06:08.950 --> 06:11.350
You shouldn't let yourself get sunburned.

06:12.090 --> 06:13.620
We've finally come to the beach,

06:13.620 --> 06:16.100
so what are you going to do if
you don't get a nice tan now?

06:18.460 --> 06:18.990
It's hot...

06:19.390 --> 06:20.400
I feel faint...

06:20.760 --> 06:23.850
That damned Pierre... he pisses me off!

06:25.870 --> 06:26.730
I'm sorry, Vanilla.

06:29.400 --> 06:30.660
Save me!

06:31.270 --> 06:31.940
Vanilla!

06:40.450 --> 06:42.320
Vanilla, are you okay?

06:44.990 --> 06:48.960
Sheesh, you guys are a handful.

06:51.720 --> 06:55.230
Dangit, I can't get excited myself!

07:04.140 --> 07:06.810
Will you please take this
to those children's room?

07:06.810 --> 07:07.230
Yes ma'am.

07:07.810 --> 07:11.110
Yuriko, you're not actually being
kind to those girls, are you?

07:11.850 --> 07:12.410
That's right!

07:14.350 --> 07:15.080
I'll take it.

07:21.720 --> 07:22.990
I'm sorry, Chocolat-chan.

07:23.590 --> 07:24.540
I got worn out...

07:25.030 --> 07:26.190
Don't worry about it, Vanilla.

07:26.190 --> 07:27.080
Just rest.

07:29.330 --> 07:29.830
Coming!

07:33.600 --> 07:34.570
How are you feeling?

07:35.300 --> 07:37.520
I'm sorry, I feel better now.

07:38.210 --> 07:40.110
I see. Are you hungry?

07:42.510 --> 07:43.180
Thank you.

07:46.010 --> 07:46.410
Wait!

07:47.280 --> 07:48.880
I have something I'd like to ask you.

07:49.880 --> 07:50.600
What is it?

07:52.120 --> 07:53.750
Do you know Glace?

07:54.360 --> 07:55.250
Glace?

07:55.520 --> 07:57.870
Then, what about the Ice Prince?

07:58.530 --> 08:00.490
I don't know, who is that?

08:01.940 --> 08:02.450
Bye.

08:05.800 --> 08:08.680
Maybe Pierre has nothing
to do with that portrait.

08:10.810 --> 08:14.440
Chocolat-chan, I think it'd be better
not to get too close to Pierre.

08:15.080 --> 08:15.850
Why?

08:16.310 --> 08:21.810
Robin-sensei told us: "Their hearts are yours to
take, but you musn't let your own be taken."

08:22.020 --> 08:22.980
I know that!

08:23.680 --> 08:27.760
But how can I take the heart of someone
as "cool" as that guy...

08:30.320 --> 08:33.330
The fortune-telling book!
Even you came along?

08:33.330 --> 08:35.500
I decided to accompany you!

08:35.830 --> 08:36.730
Okay, then tell me my fortune.

08:37.300 --> 08:39.800
How can I take Pierre's heart?

08:43.910 --> 08:45.110
Sugar Sugar Rune!

08:45.110 --> 08:46.210
Choco Rune!

08:50.140 --> 08:52.150
Divination Livre!

09:01.390 --> 09:03.520
This card means "transformation."

09:04.060 --> 09:06.190
A complete image change.

09:06.190 --> 09:09.500
More than people previously thought about
you, a fresh new look. Discover it!

09:14.470 --> 09:16.440
Transformation... aha!

09:18.410 --> 09:20.710
I'm sure there was something in the Magical
World Mail Order Catalogue.

09:21.340 --> 09:21.910
This is it!

09:23.040 --> 09:24.570
I won't have many ecure left, but...

09:25.080 --> 09:26.580
I'll buy it!

09:26.980 --> 09:28.130
I got burnt...

09:28.680 --> 09:32.990
If I can become a pretty adult,
I can get a whole lot of hearts!

09:33.880 --> 09:38.280
1... 2... 3... 4... 5... 6...

09:38.990 --> 09:40.460
Sugar Sugar Rune!

10:00.280 --> 10:02.420
How ya'll doing? I'm from the Magical
World Mail Order Catalogue.

10:02.780 --> 10:03.950
Just as fast as always!

10:04.620 --> 10:06.220
Here's the merchandise you ordered.

10:06.620 --> 10:09.120
Alright! Can I try them on?

10:10.060 --> 10:11.060
Of course, go ahead.

10:21.400 --> 10:22.640
How do you like it?

10:24.010 --> 10:26.010
No way! Is this me?

10:26.010 --> 10:30.210
Wow! I'm super-duper cool!

10:31.310 --> 10:32.950
These mules are amazing.

10:35.780 --> 10:36.370
I'll take 'em.

10:36.750 --> 10:37.690
I am SO taking 'em.

10:38.220 --> 10:39.690
That'll be 500 ecure, please.

10:42.320 --> 10:43.360
Thanks for yer buisness!

10:44.660 --> 10:49.060
Alright... tomorrow I'm
gonna take Pierre's heart!

11:00.340 --> 11:01.180
Whoa!

11:02.440 --> 11:04.280
What a babe!

11:42.280 --> 11:43.580
Wow, Chocolat-chan!

11:43.930 --> 11:45.690
Hurry up and take their hearts!

11:46.820 --> 11:48.360
Naw, they're only orange.

11:48.720 --> 11:49.420
Not worth my time.

11:50.260 --> 11:51.730
If they turn pink, I'll take them.

11:52.330 --> 11:56.560
Well, sure, orange hearts are only 300
ecure and pink are 1,000 ecure.

11:57.100 --> 11:59.430
But it's better to take them when
you have the chance...

12:00.100 --> 12:01.840
Don't worry about it!

12:05.810 --> 12:07.680
Um, this old lady relative of mine...

12:07.680 --> 12:08.340
Old lady?!

12:10.610 --> 12:13.010
Um... I met her here by coincidence.

12:14.650 --> 12:16.180
That's right, look over here.

12:18.050 --> 12:19.420
Um, maybe we could have a drink...

12:19.420 --> 12:20.920
If you'd like, get a something to eat...

12:21.260 --> 12:22.860
Want to go for a ride on my boat?

12:22.860 --> 12:25.140
Feel like making a sand castle together?

12:25.490 --> 12:26.190
Shoo, shoo.

12:30.430 --> 12:31.330
What a waste...

12:31.770 --> 12:33.170
It's all good.

12:36.000 --> 12:37.670
Oh? That looks good.

12:38.340 --> 12:39.810
What are you drinking there?

12:40.470 --> 12:41.410
I've decided.

12:43.610 --> 12:44.750
The same for her.

12:45.350 --> 12:45.610
Right away.

12:48.680 --> 12:49.970
My, thank you.

12:50.620 --> 12:52.180
You cute, little boy.

12:53.490 --> 12:54.520
My pleasure.

12:56.120 --> 12:58.710
I called Pierre a little boy!

12:59.560 --> 13:01.260
Would you like to get some lunch?

13:01.860 --> 13:02.530
I'd be glad to.

13:03.160 --> 13:05.300
Alright! The fortune-telling worked!

13:07.000 --> 13:09.100
I'll escort you, Madame.

13:10.940 --> 13:13.840
My, even though you're a child,
you really know your stuff.

13:15.910 --> 13:17.740
V-Vanilla, come with me!

13:18.210 --> 13:22.380
Madame, dates are things
you do together alone.

13:22.880 --> 13:24.450
O-Of course...

13:26.550 --> 13:28.720
And we finally went on a
trip with the Prince...

13:29.570 --> 13:31.450
Who the heck is that woman?!

13:31.760 --> 13:32.530
Quiet.

13:36.130 --> 13:38.530
Will Chocolat-chan be okay?

13:44.310 --> 13:45.270
It's hard to walk...

13:47.610 --> 13:48.140
Robin?!

13:50.440 --> 13:51.350
Are you okay?

13:51.910 --> 13:56.680
A gorgeous lady blooms in the summer,
like a large sunflower, you see.

13:57.080 --> 13:58.290
If you'd like, perhaps a drink...

13:59.850 --> 14:02.190
Why is Robin here at a time like this?

14:02.980 --> 14:05.860
What if he discovers that I'm Chocolat?

14:06.390 --> 14:06.860
Excuse me.

14:08.600 --> 14:09.960
I am escorting this lady.

14:11.200 --> 14:11.830
Let's go.

14:11.830 --> 14:13.020
Uh... yes.

14:15.370 --> 14:16.770
You go there, kid.

14:17.570 --> 14:21.600
But, who was he? He looked just like Glace.

14:29.220 --> 14:30.620
Your menu.

14:30.620 --> 14:32.250
Uh... E-E-E-E-Excuse me!

14:33.520 --> 14:36.860
This is scary... I've never been
to a restaurant like this!

14:37.760 --> 14:38.350
Expensive...

14:38.890 --> 14:40.760
I don't have that kind of money!

14:41.660 --> 14:44.300
This is my treat, Madame.

14:45.830 --> 14:47.330
Lover's cocktail for the hors d'oeuvre.

14:48.040 --> 14:49.670
Viciscious and cool pasta.

14:50.700 --> 14:52.570
And roast beef, chilled.

14:55.740 --> 14:57.240
Um... the same.

14:58.210 --> 14:58.980
Right away.

14:59.680 --> 15:01.520
What the hell is "vicisious"? What is it?

15:01.520 --> 15:04.950
What if it's something you can't eat?!

15:05.520 --> 15:09.520
I can't handle hot things, I can
only eat things that are cold.

15:10.050 --> 15:11.220
Is that okay with you?

15:11.660 --> 15:12.720
Sure.

15:14.930 --> 15:16.360
Are you Vanilla's aunt?

15:17.060 --> 15:20.730
Yes, we've been best friends
since we were little.

15:20.730 --> 15:21.640
Best friends?

15:21.640 --> 15:26.940
Um... Well, like friends between
an adult and a child...

15:27.810 --> 15:28.240
Oh?

15:29.080 --> 15:29.880
This ain't good.

15:29.880 --> 15:30.980
I've got to change the subject.

15:32.050 --> 15:34.420
So in any case, you must be really rich.

15:35.350 --> 15:36.780
Well, you look rich as well.

15:37.720 --> 15:40.250
I don't really get that big an allowance.

15:40.790 --> 15:41.460
Allowance?

15:41.890 --> 15:43.880
Yeah. Because I'm in elementary school.

15:44.190 --> 15:45.210
Elemenatary school?

15:46.560 --> 15:49.260
So then... um... um... bathroom!

15:50.870 --> 15:54.090
Is Chocolat-chan's date
with Pierre going well?

15:54.440 --> 15:57.240
I'm sure it's already fallen apart by now.

16:01.180 --> 16:02.240
Robin-sensei?

16:02.680 --> 16:05.010
Oh? If it isn't Vanilla!

16:05.010 --> 16:06.850
Are you two also on vacances?

16:06.850 --> 16:07.150
Yes.

16:07.850 --> 16:08.980
Where's Chocolat?

16:09.680 --> 16:11.090
She went to go take a heart...

16:12.950 --> 16:16.090
Summer is the season of burning love.

16:16.920 --> 16:18.540
(Sparkle!)

16:21.400 --> 16:22.260
See ya!

16:22.260 --> 16:23.760
Do your best too, Vanilla!

16:24.300 --> 16:24.770
Okay.

16:26.800 --> 16:28.400
That's Robin-sensei for you.

16:29.470 --> 16:30.940
He's a sultry guy.

16:35.510 --> 16:38.210
I've never worn high heels before.

16:41.780 --> 16:45.990
At this rate my heart will
stop before I can take his.

16:49.190 --> 16:49.790
Is everything okay?

16:51.310 --> 16:52.020
Yes.

16:53.330 --> 16:55.060
Your feet hurt, correct?

16:55.060 --> 16:56.220
I'll help you walk.

16:57.300 --> 16:57.900
Thank you.

17:00.630 --> 17:01.470
No good, no good!

17:01.470 --> 17:02.270
I can't get flustered!

17:04.040 --> 17:05.040
Oh, what is it?

17:05.810 --> 17:07.510
You are quite a cute person.

17:07.510 --> 17:09.210
Yeah! I get that a lot.

17:10.410 --> 17:11.510
Now, let's eat!

17:13.010 --> 17:16.850
Wow! That "vicisious" was great.

17:17.520 --> 17:19.720
It's a cold potato soup, I see.

17:20.710 --> 17:21.250
Yes.

17:22.060 --> 17:25.050
Well, I knew that already, of course.

17:25.960 --> 17:27.470
How cute!

17:29.360 --> 17:30.230
Shall I buy it for you?

17:30.700 --> 17:31.440
Really?!

17:33.230 --> 17:34.670
Well, I don't really want it...

17:35.470 --> 17:35.740
Oh.

17:38.870 --> 17:39.540
Too bad...

17:41.310 --> 17:42.000
What should we do?

17:43.840 --> 17:45.740
Let's go for a little walk.

17:46.180 --> 17:47.680
Okay.

18:06.170 --> 18:07.800
What's this?

18:07.800 --> 18:11.440
What the... Could this be the age control?

18:12.040 --> 18:12.940
This is bad...

18:13.440 --> 18:15.940
Uh... um...

18:17.910 --> 18:19.530
Are you okay, ma'am?

18:20.610 --> 18:21.980
Thank you, kind sir...

18:22.820 --> 18:24.320
There should be a woman around.

18:24.990 --> 18:25.850
Have you seen her?

18:26.190 --> 18:28.670
Maybe she went home?

18:29.090 --> 18:32.260
Going on a date with a kid
must have been boring.

18:32.260 --> 18:32.690
Perhaps.

18:37.460 --> 18:39.180
This time... this time...

18:41.540 --> 18:42.400
No, no!

18:46.440 --> 18:47.410
Alright! I'm back!

18:48.540 --> 18:49.770
It broke!

18:52.710 --> 18:53.780
Why are you here?

18:54.580 --> 18:56.580
It's just a coincidence, obviously!

18:56.980 --> 18:57.820
And those mules?

18:59.250 --> 19:03.120
It's just a coincidence that I bought
shoes that look like Vanilla's aunt's.

19:03.460 --> 19:04.120
Oh?

19:05.590 --> 19:07.120
Well, you can't walk like that, can you?

19:12.830 --> 19:14.300
What is with this?

19:15.440 --> 19:17.240
His heart won't come out,
no matter what.

19:18.070 --> 19:20.540
And why did it turn out like this?

19:20.940 --> 19:24.310
I actually bought mules,
but they didn't help at all.

19:27.010 --> 19:27.940
You're heavy.

19:42.060 --> 19:44.130
Chocolat-chan, are you okay?

19:47.770 --> 19:48.370
Vanilla...

19:48.900 --> 19:54.340
That surprised me... Pierre was
carrying you on his shoulders.

19:55.240 --> 19:58.480
Hey, so, did you take Pierre's heart?

20:00.910 --> 20:01.950
It was no good.

20:02.480 --> 20:03.280
Hey, Vanilla.

20:06.050 --> 20:08.260
Even if you change your appearence
to look like an adult,

20:09.620 --> 20:11.790
your heart stays that of a child, you know?

20:14.360 --> 20:19.020
Without seeing, doing,
and feeling various things,

20:19.020 --> 20:22.070
you can't become a good woman, it seems.

20:23.600 --> 20:24.170
Guess so.

20:25.510 --> 20:27.740
So, how about you? Take any hearts?

20:28.340 --> 20:30.140
Yeah, look at these!

20:30.540 --> 20:31.330
That many?

20:32.810 --> 20:34.750
I didn't do anything special.

20:35.320 --> 20:39.820
Just running on the beach, falling, and looking like I was about to drown in the sea.

20:40.520 --> 20:41.170
And I got this many.

20:41.490 --> 20:42.760
You're amazing.

20:47.930 --> 20:49.460
That was fast!

20:49.900 --> 20:50.700
What's that?

20:52.330 --> 20:57.200
Nagashi Soumen. For the Members' summer trip.

20:57.200 --> 20:58.470
Looks like fun!

21:00.170 --> 21:01.440
Wait, Chocolat-chan...

21:03.010 --> 21:04.310
I can't grab it.

21:04.910 --> 21:06.530
We don't have this in the Magical World!

21:09.020 --> 21:10.280
Uh... did you just hear that?

21:11.450 --> 21:12.250
Hear what?

21:13.420 --> 21:14.120
Never mind.

21:14.690 --> 21:16.360
Hey, this is cool.

21:17.020 --> 21:17.800
I guess.

21:18.190 --> 21:21.550
You really do like cold
things, don't you, Pierre?

21:22.300 --> 21:23.340
You know a lot, don't you?

21:25.570 --> 21:28.350
That's right. I can only eat cold things.

21:29.370 --> 21:30.700
I can't handle hot things, you see.

21:32.210 --> 21:34.710
But that's not all I can't handle.

21:35.510 --> 21:37.240
Oh? What?

21:39.180 --> 21:39.980
Carrots.

21:45.520 --> 21:46.220
Chocolat-chan...

21:47.960 --> 21:51.660
Chocolat-chan, your heart...
it's shining orange!

21:59.230 --> 22:00.270
A black heart?

22:23.080 --> 22:29.390
I light a red candle, and whisper:

22:29.520 --> 22:30.890
"Love"

22:31.830 --> 22:35.330
A magic spell.

22:37.500 --> 22:44.770
With you, there's nothing to be afraid of... probably.

22:46.200 --> 22:54.280
Please hold me. Where am I going?

22:55.950 --> 23:00.220
Take me along, take me along,

23:00.820 --> 23:03.890
To the world beyond the moon.

23:04.190 --> 23:11.260
It doesn't matter if everyone stops.

23:12.630 --> 23:16.070
To the world beyond the moon.

23:18.070 --> 23:26.180
I'll be waiting in the real world.

23:26.240 --> 23:35.090
The eternal world of which you spoke.

23:46.000 --> 23:47.740
Hiroshi disappeared?

23:48.660 --> 23:50.700
But... who's Hiroshi?

23:51.260 --> 23:54.710
Oh! That's Akira's stupid little dog!

23:55.700 --> 23:57.520
Cheer up, Akira.

23:57.520 --> 23:59.690
I'll use magic to search for him, so–

24:00.520 --> 24:03.710
Huh? Hiroshi was abducted by aliens?

24:04.260 --> 24:05.310
For real?!

24:06.170 --> 24:08.010
Next time on Sugar Sugar Rune:

24:08.440 --> 24:10.240
The gift of the green heart

24:11.400 --> 24:13.710
I wonder if aliens have hearts too?
